./docs/articles/new-expensify/expenses-&-payments/Send-an-invoice.md:Expensify will automatically notify the invoice recipient about the new invoice via email, SMS, and a mobile app notification, along with instructions on how to pay it. Daily reminders will be sent until the invoice is paid.
./docs/articles/new-expensify/expenses-&-payments/Approve-and-pay-expenses.md:When someone sends an expense or a group of expenses to you for approval, you’ll receive the expense in Expensify Chat for the related workspace. Chats with new updates appear with a green dot to the right of the chat message. Concierge also sends you an email notification for the new expense.
